<title>UK: Bad weather may close Skikda today - port official.</title>
<headline>Bad weather may close Skikda today - port official.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's Skikda port may close later on Monday due to deteriorating weather, a port official said.</p>
<p>He said the oil loading berths were already out of action due to a heavy swell, but gas tankers were still able to load because they were more sheltered.</p>
<p>However, the weather forecast was for strengthening winds and rougher seas later on Monday, and he predicted all loadings would be suspended this afternoon.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
